# Hi, I'm Suman Pathak 👋

### Technical Architect | Senior Python Backend Engineer | GenAI & LLMOps

I’m a **Senior Developer / Technical Architect** with **13+ years of software engineering experience**, specializing in **Python backend engineering, FastAPI, SQL, AWS, GenAI and LLMOps**.

I build production-grade backend systems, APIs, observability platforms and distributed architectures with a strong focus on **scalability, reliability, performance, clean architecture and developer experience**.

Currently, I work on an **LLMOps Observability platform in the insurance/enterprise AI domain**, helping engineering teams monitor, trace, evaluate and reliably export data from AI/LLM applications.

